{"id": "official:sentence:fc2f550b-f639-45d1-bdd3-45cedbcf3683", "text": "你最近检查视力了吗？", "shortMeaning": "视力你近期查过没有？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:877a2cf5-1fc2-4c56-a036-3c3bdb7cf97a", "text": "你有100万美元的话，你会做什么？", "shortMeaning": "假如有一百万美元，你会拿它干什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bcaf6b6a-a8ba-4b3c-b78f-c5705428d084", "text": "你有一个非常好的团队，但他们的是最好的。", "shortMeaning": "你的团队很好，可他们那支最出色。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b46c3f6b-f5ec-402b-be5e-11012997b0ad", "text": "你有一个非常好记的电子邮箱。", "shortMeaning": "你这个邮箱地址特别好记。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6777ffe8-9625-43c5-8f52-0106a5f338d5", "text": "你有一双很可爱的眼睛。", "shortMeaning": "你的眼睛很好看。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6c94d461-bb4d-45f5-9554-a579202a717e", "text": "你有两种选择，汤，或沙拉。", "shortMeaning": "你只有两条路：汤或者沙拉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:15a2dbf9-ce93-47e9-8fbd-b019d84981d5", "text": "你有个温馨的家庭。", "shortMeaning": "你的家让人觉得很暖。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3afc7ec6-d710-4d8b-8fd4-a1cdd63454d6", "text": "你有什么东西需要向海关申报的？", "shortMeaning": "有需要向海关申报的物品吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0ae57441-dd3e-4106-8ef4-bc1dedd8841e", "text": "你有什么事要说吗？", "shortMeaning": "你有话要讲吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f269e7f4-0923-4ae6-b824-a4559b3f969d", "text": "你有什么冰冻饮料？", "shortMeaning": "冰镇的饮料你这儿有哪种？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:063b9220-b38f-470f-960b-273d6481840d", "text": "你有什么特殊的天赋吗？", "shortMeaning": "你有哪样特别的才能吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f085b951-f49b-4b9e-9eaa-8cc28f28a7aa", "text": "你有什么话，只管说。", "shortMeaning": "有话尽管讲出来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5e69909c-c1bb-42f8-a749-77f901a67e01", "text": "你有什么需要买的吗？", "shortMeaning": "你有要买的东西吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:88722408-1f71-4a90-9af2-942190b9121d", "text": "你有何她说过话吗？", "shortMeaning": "你跟她说上过话吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e53ba39c-9a4f-40d7-908f-e5c947666ccc", "text": "你有你的爱好，我有我的兴趣，不管你甚事！", "shortMeaning": "你玩你的爱好，我有我的兴趣，与你无关！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dfc32c9a-e59a-46de-8dd9-64be3c52ba9f", "text": "你有卖这种钱包吗？", "shortMeaning": "这种钱包你这里有卖吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e34635b9-bdc6-4bf5-8eba-56d3b6993a98", "text": "你有可能不得不那么做。", "shortMeaning": "到时候你说不定非那样做不可。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b70a531b-c384-45d6-8841-4d8d966aa438", "text": "你有可能不知道这事。", "shortMeaning": "这件事你也许还不知道。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4527c0a1-39c8-4413-ae7f-33dd998ad159", "text": "你有可能会感染性传播疾病。", "shortMeaning": "你有可能染上性病。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8d14a0c3-8780-4559-b074-11d7cc16dbfc", "text": "你有和这个一样但是不同颜色的吗？", "shortMeaning": "和这个同款、颜色不同的有吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:716658a7-a7ff-4fc1-8158-fa6a6c9309c0", "text": "你有哪些推荐的动漫？", "shortMeaning": "哪几部动画你觉得值得看？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d8021366-454b-49f2-9f37-c76fcc6c0459", "text": "你有多余的钥匙吗？", "shortMeaning": "你还有多出来的钥匙吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cbb9ba26-cab7-41ad-9cf9-d013b9555bd7", "text": "你有很多钱，而我没有。", "shortMeaning": "你手头钱不少，我却一分没有。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:42c1469c-8ca2-464f-9c9d-e78d1f8d10df", "text": "你有很好的幽默感。", "shortMeaning": "你说话很逗，懂幽默。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8dadf403-7945-465e-af37-ddfea9b2d8e1", "text": "你有必要到那里去。", "shortMeaning": "你有必要跑一趟那儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e534bac8-252d-45ca-9fa2-08d44093836e", "text": "你有时间跟我吃午饭吗？", "shortMeaning": "中午有空跟我一起吃饭吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5f963879-7934-4f0f-b5ca-9bb5a2d42789", "text": "你有权使用旅馆的游泳池。", "shortMeaning": "旅馆的泳池你随便用。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:deed10fc-b6bf-4e63-8113-03a35312065a", "text": "你有没有什么喝的给我解渴吗？", "shortMeaning": "有能解渴的饮料给我吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6d1ca94c-7df3-4a74-886f-9f3ae63533e9", "text": "你有没有卖过车了？", "shortMeaning": "你卖过车没有？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f3d007e5-4681-46c8-8a24-bd1450b6da5b", "text": "你有没有电子邮件地址？", "shortMeaning": "你有邮箱地址吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ea152652-32da-4389-98cf-6377a5af3b8d", "text": "你有没有看过中文书？", "shortMeaning": "中文书你看过吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e7926f5d-c85a-44e1-aef3-3cbf8c934143", "text": "你有没有给孤儿献上一首歌呢？", "shortMeaning": "你有没有给孤儿们唱过一首歌？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b0b16712-dbcd-42df-aff9-19babbe8729a", "text": "你有没有遇到任何问题？", "shortMeaning": "你碰上什么问题了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f1308671-8dba-4132-84b0-3b59539ea09f", "text": "你有没有闻到一股煤气味？", "shortMeaning": "有没有一股煤气味飘过来？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:527b2e2e-aa79-405c-b34d-62b56bf69904", "text": "你有深海恐惧症吗？", "shortMeaning": "你对深海有恐惧吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f697e83a-219a-452d-87ca-77804a6808d4", "text": "你有看过镜子里的自己吗？", "shortMeaning": "镜子里的你，你看过吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ee972991-5ed3-40e3-a3d7-35e3a7463b00", "text": "你有种奇怪的幽默感。", "shortMeaning": "你的幽默感有点怪。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:86bcacc9-e114-4df3-9382-a4bd736af087", "text": "你有空的时候来看看我们。", "shortMeaning": "有空就过来看看我们。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:67a07f21-c2a1-4bc8-bcf7-915e6392ef2e", "text": "你有能力去做这个吗？", "shortMeaning": "这件事你有本事做吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:81452b08-364a-42bb-8220-3a4c896ceed4", "text": "你有要洗的衣服吗？", "shortMeaning": "有换下来要洗的衣服吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:65c0e3d7-8774-44d5-bb15-430067376100", "text": "你有试过数星星吗？", "shortMeaning": "你数过星星吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9a9537ef-0c1b-48eb-a01c-4bb4b5b7da22", "text": "你有说得太快了的倾向。", "shortMeaning": "你说话容易越说越快。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9a030912-3d5d-4a15-bffc-671652a7780c", "text": "你有足够到睡眠吗？", "shortMeaning": "你睡得够不够？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2a28d23d-96aa-4066-8086-6be93c41be69", "text": "你有足够的食物吗？", "shortMeaning": "吃的东西够不够？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a6310b18-b632-4823-ab8a-e7f4c4653dfd", "text": "你有这么多的生活阅历，敢问你年方几何？", "shortMeaning": "你经历这么多，敢问贵庚多少？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d7636207-fa86-42cd-aea1-a118b03c2246", "text": "你有这扇门的钥匙吗？", "shortMeaning": "这门的钥匙在你手上吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5c11ad98-729b-446b-bf76-f54a3b4d17c2", "text": "你有道理。我打车去。", "shortMeaning": "你说得对，我打车过去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ccb8aa4d-8cd3-48b9-9369-2e7480f6f901", "text": "你有钱的话，借我一些。", "shortMeaning": "手头有钱就借我一点儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7f5fd9ed-ef31-4d96-b864-d7b3fb519d70", "text": "你有问题就给我发信息。", "shortMeaning": "遇到问题给我发条消息。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3ce9e76b-f6e3-4881-aae6-ceaccd6510c7", "text": "你有陈红的联系方式吗？", "shortMeaning": "你存着陈红的电话吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:997cad15-1589-481a-a473-95f1cf74c3ce", "text": "你有除锈的东西吗？", "shortMeaning": "有没有除锈的药剂？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d5c28ace-f49c-4fa9-82e9-216e6d43f4ac", "text": "你朋友是什么时候出发去美国的？", "shortMeaning": "你朋友哪一天动身去美国？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4f65bc79-8777-447f-a4e5-6d2d240b42ec", "text": "你期望我能相信这个？", "shortMeaning": "你以为这我会信？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:18b17aeb-0e74-49a9-bfc8-2084baa51c7a", "text": "你本不该把人卖了的。", "shortMeaning": "你不该把人卖出去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:39d17b0b-6fd3-4819-aea6-09ca19ace156", "text": "你本不该透露秘密的。", "shortMeaning": "这个秘密你本不该说出去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:37bb16a0-76fb-4541-92f0-5f76000f297f", "text": "你本来以为我想说什么？", "shortMeaning": "你原以为我要讲什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:faff2f0f-e476-46fe-807d-b8b470cb2bbf", "text": "你本该拒绝一个那么不公平的提议。", "shortMeaning": "那么不公的提议，你该拒绝才对。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d65bfd49-e594-451c-a290-bbd334101544", "text": "你来到大阪的时候请跟我联络。", "shortMeaning": "到了大阪请联系我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:16b3ad5f-1a21-4c81-87ca-36323747ceed", "text": "你来的时候我刚好要走。", "shortMeaning": "你到的那会儿我正要出门。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ce9dc73d-6401-4132-afda-a68bb7aa27a6", "text": "你来看我真是太好了。", "shortMeaning": "你能来看我，真让人高兴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0072bb26-0cf5-496a-829d-dbeab3a475a7", "text": "你来自加拿大哪个部分？", "shortMeaning": "加拿大你是哪个地方的人？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:de54cdd7-6cf6-4ffa-bc46-0a0a87329638", "text": "你来自加拿大的哪里？", "shortMeaning": "加拿大哪一带是你的家乡？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9354dd83-2840-454a-bccb-247ab97fdd42", "text": "你正在把我杯子里的东西喝掉。", "shortMeaning": "你喝的是我杯里的东西。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1c23e5ff-dca3-46f0-a201-901a9ee0d1a5", "text": "你母亲说六种语言真是让人难以置信！", "shortMeaning": "你妈妈会讲六种语言，真叫人不敢相信！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1b18aae5-c59c-4fb6-b95e-edfc4818046a", "text": "你每个月洗几次车？", "shortMeaning": "车子你一个月洗几回？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:51840e6a-48fd-42dd-8191-52a15efdb73a", "text": "你每天早上都刮胡子吗？", "shortMeaning": "你天天早上都刮脸吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0763e400-cbf0-49be-828c-9886580e4b3d", "text": "你每次都忘记拿钱。", "shortMeaning": "每回你都忘了带钱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d10b9b5b-6cb4-4a74-9027-c54ca4a93df2", "text": "你每次都继续犯同样的错误。", "shortMeaning": "同样的错你一再犯。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bf96fd94-d028-4a5f-8a66-c1e016a46543", "text": "你永远不会孤身一人的。", "shortMeaning": "你不会一直是一个人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:735f7ff6-0cb6-4952-9e7e-b82c5acb7390", "text": "你永远不会知道真相。", "shortMeaning": "真相你一辈子都不会知道。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:46db04e7-edae-49d4-83e2-0e5b8b0efb0f", "text": "你永远不知道会发生什么。", "shortMeaning": "将来出什么事，你永远料不到。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0cb845d8-480c-4481-b833-e65ce51ea6ce", "text": "你永远也成为不了计算机科学家。", "shortMeaning": "计算机科学家你一辈子也当不上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bd14a48e-8b42-4b41-9ccc-170e3cc1797e", "text": "你永远都不能太自我。", "shortMeaning": "人什么时候都不能太顾自己。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:24cef639-22c2-4221-945c-3c45f591f9c2", "text": "你汉语学了几年了？", "shortMeaning": "你中文已经学了几年？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:20d109c3-4a18-4937-920d-b1122c1ff197", "text": "你没发现中国人很少指出你的语病吗？", "shortMeaning": "中国人大都懒得挑你话里的毛病，你没察觉？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1fd5201e-22b6-423e-a050-c02f8eba1aea", "text": "你没在吃任何东西。", "shortMeaning": "你什么也没在吃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:039e87b9-4902-4d00-a147-cdeedd0f782f", "text": "你没在跟我开玩笑吧？", "shortMeaning": "你不是在拿我寻开心吧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:01f18640-5d71-450e-bb72-08ede35fbf66", "text": "你没必要周日去上学。", "shortMeaning": "星期天你不用去上课。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7ef5f6c3-9ae3-4ecf-97ef-a72befba31b9", "text": "你没必要待到最后。", "shortMeaning": "你不必留到最后。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3a994b19-4813-4fce-9212-0c06816cb8db", "text": "你没必要提前支付房租。", "shortMeaning": "房租不用提前交。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a2cb5836-1a5a-414f-80e7-eb1251ac1700", "text": "你没必要那么正式。", "shortMeaning": "你用不着那么拘礼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cf86af65-d159-4bae-88ba-061788c9ea5e", "text": "你没必要马上去做。", "shortMeaning": "这事不必立刻就办。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:25e813dc-6b26-428d-a344-4011b58d0aa7", "text": "你没打算耍我，对吧？", "shortMeaning": "你没想捉弄我，是吧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:180d5c51-3c87-4d64-9096-e76003aa4327", "text": "你没有把你的车上锁吗？", "shortMeaning": "你的车没锁上吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:927f0651-c896-4a31-9a36-72c086ad8a12", "text": "你没有非去不可的必要。", "shortMeaning": "你没有一定要去的道理。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7108b501-df0f-4212-bdee-0600b99d05e1", "text": "你没法说服一个傻子。", "shortMeaning": "跟傻子讲不通。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:99707abc-5613-4ca0-85da-a6e3f9d7efcc", "text": "你没理由觉得自己比别人差的。", "shortMeaning": "你没道理觉得自己不如人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6d5fa1a7-dd9b-4d68-b72c-afa1453754e9", "text": "你没看到那个男人吗？", "shortMeaning": "那个男人你没瞧见？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8fa4cbc0-a933-4127-80fe-450c762bdd06", "text": "你没看见那个人吗？", "shortMeaning": "那个人你没看到吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a2de408e-632a-4d9b-9214-8f463a451aef", "text": "你活着，但是却不知道为什么活着。", "shortMeaning": "你活着，却说不清为什么活。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:feef3332-3d4b-483e-bc4f-cfdb3956be5c", "text": "你游泳很棒，不是吗？", "shortMeaning": "你泳游得挺好，不是吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:58afe0fa-a060-4e9a-81d8-aa9f6783836b", "text": "你游泳游得比他好得多。", "shortMeaning": "论游泳，你比他强不少。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:458e9618-6cbd-48ee-86c8-73f6b51e1763", "text": "你游泳游得比我好。", "shortMeaning": "你水性比我好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c7b64d4c-ca19-438a-a2e3-8d948056bc9f", "text": "你熟悉这个领域吗？", "shortMeaning": "这一行你熟不熟？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7386646d-a414-4739-a492-f880c4622f96", "text": "你爱我不如我爱你那么多。", "shortMeaning": "你对我的爱，没有我给你的多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:17e05338-6d33-417d-807b-48ce4c79eb5e", "text": "你爱我只是因为我是个黑人吗？", "shortMeaning": "你爱我，只因为我是黑人？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:95839fc9-dc94-4c59-b6ba-8b9d28db0b54", "text": "你爱拿多少就拿多少。", "shortMeaning": "想拿多少尽管拿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:76e922d4-cfed-4775-874d-4017be80c8e8", "text": "你父亲想让你上大学吧。", "shortMeaning": "你爸盼着你念大学吧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b14d7a2d-64c5-4037-a580-d8b523d5cbde", "text": "你父亲是做什么的？", "shortMeaning": "你爸是干什么工作的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bf7071a1-3740-49f3-a3eb-b3a5e7f582b4", "text": "你爸爸做什么工作？", "shortMeaning": "你父亲干的是哪一行？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
